OL,3,GNEWSANew van rules for tips to tackle
OL,4,A'trade waste abuse'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new booking system at recycling
OL,7,Fcentres in Nottinghamshire will be
OL,8,Fintroduced for van owners.
OL,10,FFrom 2 January, van owners will need to
OL,11,Fre-register to book an appointment to
OL,12,Fvisit recycling centres, with drops
OL,13,Flimited to six visits a year.
OL,15,FNottinghamshire County Council said the
OL,16,Famount of "certain types of waste"
OL,17,Fbeing taken to its sites suggested some
OL,18,Fwere using them for trade waste, which
OL,19,Fis not accepted.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
